      "side": 1,
      "message": "I noticed that hardware/interfaces/audio/aidl/default/Module.cpp Module::checkAudioPatchEndpointsMatch is an empty implementation:\n\nndk::ScopedAStatus Module::checkAudioPatchEndpointsMatch(\n        const std::vector\u003cAudioPortConfig*\u003e\u0026 sources __unused,\n        const std::vector\u003cAudioPortConfig*\u003e\u0026 sinks __unused) {\n    LOG(VERBOSE) \u003c\u003c __func__ \u003c\u003c \": do nothing and return ok\";\n    return ndk::ScopedAStatus::ok();\n}\n\nIf I do likewise in ModuleRemoteSubmix::checkAudioPatchEndpointsMatch, this gets closer to the implementation working.\n\nIs this an acceptable fix?",
